# $project_name

A trading strategy for [Straufi](https://straufi.com).

Write your strategy in `strategy.py`.

Run these commands from the project's virtual environment (e.g. `uv run straufi build`):

```sh
straufi build      # Upload the code and build it on Straufi
straufi backtest   # Open the page to test a build on past data
straufi deploy     # Open the page to run a build
straufi status     # See how it goes
```
